{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49038","headline":"新栽松 · 文丙","name":"新栽松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可怜同百草，况负雪霜姿。\n歌舞地不尚，岁寒人自移。\n堦除添冷淡，毫末入思惟。\n尽道生云洞，谁知露嶮巇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"文丙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}